2. Automated rollback triggers within 2 minutes of threshold breach
3. Zero configuration drift between environments
4. Warm-up completes within 30 seconds
5. Full deployment or rollback in under 15 minutes

### Risk Mitigation Summary

| Risk | Mitigation | Owner |
|------|------------|-------|
| Slow warm-up | Pre-warming + synthetic load | Platform Team |
| Config drift | IaC + drift detection | DevOps Team |
| Rollback failure | Automated + tested runbooks | SRE Team |
| Database issues | Backward-compatible migrations | DBA Team |

---

**Report Generated: Atlas Delta Deployment Analysis**
